type_name="gh_guid" type_code="9">59e0b89a-e487-49f8-bab8-b5bab16be14c</item><item name="Name" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Panel</item></items><chunks count="1"><chunk name="Container"><items count="8"><item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">A panel for custom notes and text values</item><item name="InstanceGuid" type_name="gh_guid" type_code="9">ef6b4a44-311c-4773-ac01-f09076e33b34</item><item name="Name" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Panel</item><item name="NickName" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10"></item><item name="Optional" type_name="gh_bool" type_code="1">false</item><item name="ScrollRatio" type_name="gh_double" type_code="6">0</item><item name="SourceCount" type_name="gh_int32" type_code="3">0</item><item name="UserText" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">BRICK PATTERN HOUSE · خانهٔ الگوی آجری · Tehran, 2011
Architect: Alireza Mashhadimirza.

A study of the idea: a brick mashrabiya over the whole street façade, open where light and privacy allow,
closed elsewhere; the pattern was given to the masons as a table, course by course (here: the Raj sheet).
Perforation follows a field that opens towards the middle of each storey band.
All credit for the design belongs to its architect. Units: metres.</item></items><chunks count="2"><chunk name="Attributes"><items count="5"><item name="Bounds" type_name="gh_drawing_rectanglef" type_code="35"><X>40</X><Y>20</Y><W>680</W><H>150</H></item><item name="MarginLeft" type_name="gh_int32" type_code="3">0</item><item name="MarginRight" type_name="gh_int32" type_code="3">0</item><item name="MarginTop" type_name="gh_int32" type_code="3">0</item><item name="Pivot" type_name="gh_drawing_pointf" type_code="31"><X>380.0</X><Y>95.0</Y></item></items></chunk><chunk name="PanelProperties"><items count="7"><item name="Colour" type_name="gh_drawing_color" type_code="36"><ARGB>255;255;250;90</ARGB></item><item name="DrawIndices" type_name="gh_bool" type_code="1">true</item><item name="DrawPaths" type_name="gh_bool" type_code="1">true</item><item name="Multiline" type_name="gh_bool" type_code="1">true</item><item name="SpecialCodes" type_name="gh_bool" type_code="1">false</item><item name="Stream" type_name="gh_bool" type_code="1">false</item><item name="Wrap" type_name="gh_bool" type_code="1">true</item></items></chunk></chunks></chunk></chunks></chunk><chunk name="Object" index="1"><items count="2"><item name="GUID" type_name="gh_guid" type_code="9">fbac3e32-f100-4292-8692-77240a42fd1a</item><item name="Name" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Point</item></items><chunks count="1"><chunk name="Container"><items count="6"><item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Contains a collection of three-dimensional points</item><item name="InstanceGuid" type_name="gh_guid" type_code="9">a4e311f1-84f9-44d7-85df-a1e990e5fae6</item><item name="Name" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Point</item><item name="NickName" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Pt</item><item name="Optional" type_name="gh_bool" type_code="1">false</item><item name="SourceCount" type_name="gh_int32" type_code="3">0</item></items><chunks count="2"><chunk name="Attributes"><items count